{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/extras/0e90754348fd03339feb0d92c1ef920c.poster.avif?t=1763972212\" width=614 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/extras/0e90754348fd03339feb0d92c1ef920c.webm?t=1763972212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/extras/0e90754348fd03339feb0d92c1ef920c.mp4?t=1763972212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Cold War isn't cold anymore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Scandinavian peninsula has become the frontline in the battle between East and West. Tactical nuclear warfare has devastated society and a massive evacuation helped many escape - not everyone could be saved.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/extras/f3abe3b984193b49ce8c17f5a372911a.avif?t=1763972212\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Transmitt:\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot, Build, Plunder, and send the radio signal for freedom. STRIDEN is the fast-paced, sandbox looter shooter survival game that\u2019ll get your blood pumping. Your team of five is battling against three other teams to collect 15,000 points and be the first to activate the radio transmitter for the extraction helicopter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plunder:</strong>\u00a0Break through locked areas or find hidden objects. Discover food, drinks, weapon parts and blueprints that give you advantages for equipment and points. Take everything you find, stay alive, and be aware of the radioactive storm! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build:</strong> Secure a Stronghold, construct defenses, purchase and upgrade your weapons. Ensure your team is prepared to fight for the electro pods needed for your radio transmitter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extraction:</strong> Gather the electro-tubes from the air supplies and construct your radio transmitter inside your Stronghold. Defend your Stronghold at all costs until the radio signal is sent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/extras/3746b86848eff46effd7d0b2846af204.poster.avif?t=1763972212\" width=614 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/extras/3746b86848eff46effd7d0b2846af204.webm?t=1763972212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/extras/3746b86848eff46effd7d0b2846af204.mp4?t=1763972212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/extras/98e431f643b78a0cfad0ff70ac9fcd6d.avif?t=1763972212\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re introducing a classic game mode into the Striden world - Kontroll.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 vs 5, a close combat area, and three different zones you\u2019re able to capture. Get a taste of the new map Nuke 08, progress faster and try out different loadouts. A perfect game mode to prepare your self for the Transmitt Game Mode.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/extras/25165d4d9c4b5a031795df795e10e8e6.avif?t=1763972212\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump in solo or play up to four players in our co-op map, where you need to survive raids of enemies and tanks that want to destroy your stronghold. Scavenge food, weapons parts, and blueprints to build and fortify your Stronghold.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive all the raids?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/extras/c41b841e01e0108bb02db10643c2cf5c.avif?t=1763972212\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/extras/1e30b19a433b113d34c3e9c35107c1b2.poster.avif?t=1763972212\" width=800 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/extras/1e30b19a433b113d34c3e9c35107c1b2.webm?t=1763972212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/extras/1e30b19a433b113d34c3e9c35107c1b2.mp4?t=1763972212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your energy and charge through the chaos of war. Powerspikes give you the advantage to gain the upper hand against your opponents. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a radioactive bear or clear the path with a moose tank. Fly, hook or bomb enemies with the eagles. The bond between humans and animals has always been strong in Scandinavia. Now more than ever, it's crucial to utilize this connection to escape.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/extras/14f5f5e1340bb245d099aa9f219aa9aa.avif?t=1763972212\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collaboration is crucial as each player has a vital role to play. Battles will be intense and strategic. It's essential to ensure enemy positioning, weapon choice, and effective communication for survival. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/extras/9510e0d250fb2eceb741f33a56a94409.avif?t=1763972212\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between five distinct roles, each with its own specific equipment. The roles include Assault, Engineer, Medic, Scout, and Support, each plays a vital role in the team's success. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/extras/9fa45f6c4af9c902e3f54e621d81e476.avif?t=1763972212\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/extras_big/9fa45f6c4af9c902e3f54e621d81e476.avif?t=1763972212 width=800 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/extras/9456896821d90628781569ff8a52ef47.avif?t=1763972212\" width=600 height=120 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/extras/094d71c03d27b870e35eb64ca54beb3f.poster.avif?t=1763972212\" width=614 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/extras/094d71c03d27b870e35eb64ca54beb3f.webm?t=1763972212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/extras/094d71c03d27b870e35eb64ca54beb3f.mp4?t=1763972212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase weapons from WWI, WWII, the Cold War, and Scandinavian arms. You have a wide selection of different weapons that you can buy, progress and upgrade with your weapon parts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/extras/503e0cc01616501cf4d1efe0a353c67d.avif?t=1763972212\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looting is simple and fast, without the need for a detailed inventory system. Everything you loot will be easy to navigate and use in your inventory. Upgrade and fortify your Stronghold through our building system, ensuring a powerful defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/extras/dd4322d178be4fc53e366379ed39613e.avif?t=1763972212\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The radioactive storm arises from the attacks in Scandinavia. The storm is toxic, dangerous, and terrifying to come into contact with. Take cover in a Stronghold or use a gas mask and step into the uncertainty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/extras/c727455ab3b474dff6890b2f971a8d2e.avif?t=1763972212\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/extras_big/c727455ab3b474dff6890b2f971a8d2e.avif?t=1763972212 width=800 height=218 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2052970?t=1763972212","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/c5827d74a53136a4f6a400a448f27c3d235f4d84/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763972212","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/494b8c721b73cb6ba8c13e1e7619e8eaf1325395/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763972212","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/494b8c721b73cb6ba8c13e1e7619e8eaf1325395/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763972212","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Frequent Violence or Gore, General Mature Content"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/extras/0e90754348fd03339feb0d92c1ef920c.poster.avif?t=1763972212\" width=614 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/extras/0e90754348fd03339feb0d92c1ef920c.webm?t=1763972212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/extras/0e90754348fd03339feb0d92c1ef920c.mp4?t=1763972212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Cold War isn't cold anymore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Scandinavian peninsula has become the frontline in the battle between East and West. Tactical nuclear warfare has devastated society and a massive evacuation helped many escape - not everyone could be saved.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/extras/f3abe3b984193b49ce8c17f5a372911a.avif?t=1763972212\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Transmitt:\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot, Build, Plunder, and send the radio signal for freedom. STRIDEN is the fast-paced, sandbox looter shooter survival game that\u2019ll get your blood pumping. Your team of five is battling against three other teams to collect 15,000 points and be the first to activate the radio transmitter for the extraction helicopter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plunder:</strong>\u00a0Break through locked areas or find hidden objects. Discover food, drinks, weapon parts and blueprints that give you advantages for equipment and points. Take everything you find, stay alive, and be aware of the radioactive storm! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build:</strong> Secure a Stronghold, construct defenses, purchase and upgrade your weapons. Ensure your team is prepared to fight for the electro pods needed for your radio transmitter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extraction:</strong> Gather the electro-tubes from the air supplies and construct your radio transmitter inside your Stronghold. Defend your Stronghold at all costs until the radio signal is sent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/extras/3746b86848eff46effd7d0b2846af204.poster.avif?t=1763972212\" width=614 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/extras/3746b86848eff46effd7d0b2846af204.webm?t=1763972212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/extras/3746b86848eff46effd7d0b2846af204.mp4?t=1763972212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/extras/98e431f643b78a0cfad0ff70ac9fcd6d.avif?t=1763972212\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re introducing a classic game mode into the Striden world - Kontroll.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 vs 5, a close combat area, and three different zones you\u2019re able to capture. Get a taste of the new map Nuke 08, progress faster and try out different loadouts. A perfect game mode to prepare your self for the Transmitt Game Mode.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/extras/25165d4d9c4b5a031795df795e10e8e6.avif?t=1763972212\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump in solo or play up to four players in our co-op map, where you need to survive raids of enemies and tanks that want to destroy your stronghold. Scavenge food, weapons parts, and blueprints to build and fortify your Stronghold.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive all the raids?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/extras/c41b841e01e0108bb02db10643c2cf5c.avif?t=1763972212\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/extras/1e30b19a433b113d34c3e9c35107c1b2.poster.avif?t=1763972212\" width=800 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/extras/1e30b19a433b113d34c3e9c35107c1b2.webm?t=1763972212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/extras/1e30b19a433b113d34c3e9c35107c1b2.mp4?t=1763972212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your energy and charge through the chaos of war. Powerspikes give you the advantage to gain the upper hand against your opponents. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a radioactive bear or clear the path with a moose tank. Fly, hook or bomb enemies with the eagles. The bond between humans and animals has always been strong in Scandinavia. Now more than ever, it's crucial to utilize this connection to escape.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/extras/14f5f5e1340bb245d099aa9f219aa9aa.avif?t=1763972212\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collaboration is crucial as each player has a vital role to play. Battles will be intense and strategic. It's essential to ensure enemy positioning, weapon choice, and effective communication for survival. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/extras/9510e0d250fb2eceb741f33a56a94409.avif?t=1763972212\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between five distinct roles, each with its own specific equipment. The roles include Assault, Engineer, Medic, Scout, and Support, each plays a vital role in the team's success. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/extras/9fa45f6c4af9c902e3f54e621d81e476.avif?t=1763972212\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/extras_big/9fa45f6c4af9c902e3f54e621d81e476.avif?t=1763972212 width=800 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/extras/9456896821d90628781569ff8a52ef47.avif?t=1763972212\" width=600 height=120 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/extras/094d71c03d27b870e35eb64ca54beb3f.poster.avif?t=1763972212\" width=614 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/extras/094d71c03d27b870e35eb64ca54beb3f.webm?t=1763972212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/extras/094d71c03d27b870e35eb64ca54beb3f.mp4?t=1763972212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase weapons from WWI, WWII, the Cold War, and Scandinavian arms. You have a wide selection of different weapons that you can buy, progress and upgrade with your weapon parts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/extras/503e0cc01616501cf4d1efe0a353c67d.avif?t=1763972212\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looting is simple and fast, without the need for a detailed inventory system. Everything you loot will be easy to navigate and use in your inventory. Upgrade and fortify your Stronghold through our building system, ensuring a powerful defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/extras/dd4322d178be4fc53e366379ed39613e.avif?t=1763972212\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The radioactive storm arises from the attacks in Scandinavia. The storm is toxic, dangerous, and terrifying to come into contact with. Take cover in a Stronghold or use a gas mask and step into the uncertainty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/extras/c727455ab3b474dff6890b2f971a8d2e.avif?t=1763972212\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/extras_big/c727455ab3b474dff6890b2f971a8d2e.avif?t=1763972212 width=800 height=218 /></span></p>","developers":["5 Fortress","Yahaha Games"],"drm_notice":"None","genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052970/8499cb8ac4d6d8ac92bf8829127ef0af03ecef8c/header.jpg?t=1763972212","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"All rights reserved 5 Fortress AB","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steam